   "text": "Deploy (Docker + Kubernetes): 3 deployments — experience (Web Experience API + WS gateway + build React) ·\ncore (Process + System APIs) · monitorizacao (escala com nº de sensores)\nStatefulSets: Mosquitto (volume persistente) e PostgreSQL (2 schemas)",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "re102_6177",
   "originalText": "Deploy (Docker + Kubernetes): 3 deployments — experience (Web Experience API + WS gateway + build React) ·\ncore (Process + System APIs) · monitorizacao (escala com nº de sensores)\nStatefulSets: Mosquitto (volume persistente) e PostgreSQL (2 schemas)",
